<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea to set up OTC stock index in January.</title>
<headline>S.Korea to set up OTC stock index in January.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>A composite stock index for South Korea's over-the-counter shares will debut on January 3, the Ministry of Finance and Economy said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The KOSDAQ Index, made up of 438 counters, will be updated every minute.</p>
<p>The weighted average of stock prices on July 1, 1996, will be the base period, for which the index is set at 100.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
